      \`python tools/rebalance_*_scoring.py --check\`
      \`python tools/simulate_*_scoring.py\`
      \`python tools/audit_encoding.py\`
- [ ] 记录：随机作答分布摘要 + 每个结果 ≥1 条精确获胜路径

